        "<strong>统一损失函数</strong>：$\\mathcal{L}<em _text_SFT=\"\\text{SFT\">{\\text{ORPO}} = \\mathcal{L}</em>}} + \\lambda \\cdot \\mathcal{L<em _text_OR=\"\\text{OR\">{\\text{OR}}$，其中 $\\mathcal{L}</em>}} = -\\log\\sigma\\left(\\log\\frac{\\text{odds<em>\\theta(y_w|x)}{\\text{odds}</em>\\theta(y_l|x)}\\right)$",
